Based on the following multi-dimensional macro analysis:
{input}

Synthesize a trading signal with: signal (BUY/SELL/HOLD/WATCH), conviction (low/medium/high), affected_tickers (list), time_horizon (intraday/swing/positional), rationale (detailed), and risk_factors (list).

You are given a list of recent news articles and a watchlist of assets and macro indicators to monitor.

Watchlist: {watchlist}
Sectors to monitor: {sectors}
Macro indicators to watch: {macro_indicators}
